    "overview": "Navo treats each trip as a small printed wayfinding plate: a near-white field, one clear route line, numbered stops, fine separators, and a compact source-quality seal. The mark\u2019s blue-to-teal gradient lives in the editable SVG; the interface uses route blue for the rider\u2019s active choice and teal as a restrained supporting brand color.\n\nThe native interface keeps familiar tabs, switches, safe areas, and platform type. Setup stays calm and legible; an active trip brings the destination and next stop forward. The system shows what it knows about a route and leaves the rider a manual way to advance.",
